@Teresa: If they agree a 2nd floor sub. lease is fine with them (rather than having to take the 2nd floor).
@Amy A. I would start thinking about moving to a larger room. The smaller room isn't always a deal breaker.
Amy A.: I moved from 1 bedroom to 2 bedrooms last summer. It was an easier transition for me with 2 bedrooms. They are the ones that are most likely to say no to a new tenant. The 1 bedroom usually have someone living with them. I think they also like the extra head room.
Teresa: I always do a new search when I add another room. Usually tenants come clean with a better attitude when they have another person to share the roof.
